{"step_index":213,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:12:20Z","thinking":"**Confirming UTF-8 BOM Presence**\n\nObserve that the file has a UTF-8 BOM. This is critical for ensuring correct Korean character display in Excel on Korean Windows systems when opening a `.csv` file. The presence of the BOM prevents encoding errors, ensuring that Korean text characters are displayed properly. The file's headers confirm the file contains Korean data.\n\n\n**Identifying File Configurations**\n\nObserved existing files to determine available data column counts (17 and 18). Confirmed the need to create CSV files per user's instruction. Considered generating three CSV files with 16, 17, and 18 columns, respectively, in a specified directory.\nDetermined the necessary column headers for each file based on the file names and the requested specifications. Plan to use a scripting environment to ensure CSV formatting, including UTF-8 BOM, and proper escaping.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Script to export verified 200 rows as CSVs with UTF-8 BOM to Desktop/오늘","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst todayDir = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘';\nif (!fs.existsSync(todayDir)) {\n  fs.mkdirSync(todayDir, { recursive: true });\n}\n\nfunction toCsvRow(cells) {\n  return cells.map(val => {\n    const s = String(val === undefined || val === null ? '' : val).trim();\n    if (s.includes(',') || s.includes('\"') || s.includes('\\n') || s.includes('\\r')) {\n      return '\"' + s.replace(/\"/g, '\"\"') + '\"';\n    }\n    return s;\n  }).join(',');\n}\n\n// 17 columns\nconst headers17 = [\n  '비고', '회사명', '사업자번호', '대표자', '우편번호', '주소', '전화번호', '팩스번호',\n  '홈페이지', '이메일', '종업원수', '업종(NICE BizINFO(업종)참고', '법인번호', '결산월',\n  '업종_대', '업종_중', '업종_소'\n];\n\n// 16 columns\nconst headers16 = [\n  '회사명', '사업자번호', '대표자', '우편번호', '주소', '전화번호', '팩스번호',\n  '홈페이지', '이메일', '종업원수', '업종(NICE BizINFO(업종)참고', '법인번호', '결산월',\n  '업종_대', '업종_중', '업종_소'\n];\n\n// 18 columns\nconst headers18 = [\n  '작성자', '비고', '회사명', '사업자번호', '대표자', '우편번호', '주소', '전화번호', '팩스번호',\n  '홈페이지', '이메일', '종업원수', '업종(NICE BizINFO(업종)참고', '법인번호', '결산월',\n  '업종_대', '업종_중', '업종_소'\n];\n\nconst lines17 = fs.readFileSync('rows_15001_15200_17col.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.length > 0);\nconst lines16 = fs.readFileSync('rows_15001_15200_16col.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.length > 0);\nconst lines18 = fs.readFileSync('rows_15001_15200_18col.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.length > 0);\n\n// Build CSV strings with UTF-8 BOM (\\uFEFF)\nconst csv17 = '\\uFEFF' + [toCsvRow(headers17), ...lines17.map(l => toCsvRow(l.split('\\t')))].join('\\r\\n');\nconst csv16 = '\\uFEFF' + [toCsvRow(headers16), ...lines16.map(l => toCsvRow(l.split('\\t')))].join('\\r\\n');\nconst csv18 = '\\uFEFF' + [toCsvRow(headers18), ...lines18.map(l => toCsvRow(l.split('\\t')))].join('\\r\\n');\n\n// Target file paths\nconst file17 = path.join(todayDir, '배현명_실사DB_200개기업_17컬럼_검증완료.csv');\nconst file16 = path.join(todayDir, '배현명_실사DB_200개기업_16컬럼_검증완료.csv');\nconst file18 = path.join(todayDir, '배현명_실사DB_200개기업_18컬럼_작성자포함.csv');\n\nfs.writeFileSync(file17, csv17, 'utf-8');\nfs.writeFileSync(file16, csv16, 'utf-8');\nfs.writeFileSync(file18, csv18, 'utf-8');\n\nconsole.log('Successfully written 3 CSV files to', todayDir);\nconsole.log('1. ', file17, '(', fs.statSync(file17).size, 'bytes )');\nconsole.log('2. ', file16, '(', fs.statSync(file16).size, 'bytes )');\nconsole.log('3. ', file18, '(', fs.statSync(file18).size, 'bytes )');\n","Description":"Write verified CSVs to Desktop/오늘","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473\\scratch\\save_to_today_folder.js","toolAction":"Creating CSV export script","toolSummary":"Write save_to_today_folder.js"}}]}
